sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    box {{phone_box}} On the phone
        participant V as VAD isolate
        participant S as STT isolate
        participant M as Main isolate
        participant T as TTS isolate
    end
    box {{cloud_box}} Cloud
        participant G as Groq LLM
    end

    U->>V: speaks
    V->>M: speech start
    M-->>G: open the connection early
    loop every ~0.7 s while speaking
        V->>S: turn audio so far
        S-->>M: live transcript
    end
    U->>V: stops talking
    V->>S: 200 ms pause: early final decode
    Note over V: 0.7 s of silence
    V->>M: end of turn
    S->>M: final transcript (~0.4 s after end of turn)
    M->>G: transcript + recent history
    G-->>M: first token (~0.43 s)
    M->>T: first phrase (3 words)
    T->>U: first audio (~0.48 s after first token)
    Note over U,G: last spoken word to first reply audio: ~2.1 s median
    loop until the reply ends
        G-->>M: more tokens
        M->>T: next phrase
        T->>U: played back to back
    end
    Note over U,M: reply ends, the mic reopens
